      "sequence_position": 1,
      "problem": "Given that $P(S|T)=0.3,$ $P(S)=0.6,$ and $P(T)=0.5,$ compute $P(T|S).$",
      "worked_solution": "Using Bayes' theorem, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(T|S) & =\\frac{P(S|T)P(T)}{P(S)} \\\\  & =\\frac{(0.3)(0.5)}{0.6} \\\\  & =\\frac{0.15}{0.6} \\\\  & =0.25.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
